ame is available to all platforms ✅\n\n❌ We catch and ban cheaters. Don't cheat! ❌\n\nLeave a like 👍 and favorite ⭐ for more updates!","path":"/game/7540727946-hoops-life-basketball","slug":"7540727946-hoops-life-basketball","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3fd17a6695ed89dcf63e46701703b717d5aabe2eab643f4a22ad9158c880ed9c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-938cf26e5b55ef54764182b1c2732248/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":137262675,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-25T08:19:07.510Z","creator":{"name":"Hoops Life","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":12,"freeCount":12,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11701792069,"name":"Snow Plow Simulator","desc":"❄️ Welcome To Snow Plow Simulator!\n\n🏔️ Clear The Roads Of Snow!\n🎉Unlock New Tools And Vehicles\n🎮 Play With Friends And Have Fun!\n\n🛠️ Release - 11/12/2022\n\n👀 Update 1.7.0:\n     - Updated Map\n     - 2 New Vehicles\n     - New Daily Quests\n     - Updated Settings\n     - GUI Updates\n     - Much Much More\n\n⭐ Please Remember To Like And Favorite The Game To Help Us Out!\n\n🚀Join Our Social Links Below To Find Out About Updates And Report Any Bugs Or Suggestions.","path":"/game/11701792069-snow-plow-simulator","slug":"11701792069-snow-plow-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/990188da4e281d71e63274c6e043c5a44569871a2f27bd4e0f9e6f74a0b6e9de.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-67bda8a10f51577fdd05db2915d2b587/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":63554287,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-12-20T19:04:45.150Z","creator":{"name":"Boolio Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2986677229,"name":"Giant Simulator","desc":"👍Like ⭐Favorite and 🔊Follow the game for more updates!\r\nUse code TYFORTHELIKES for 100k gold!!\r\nNew code at 175K likes!\r\n[Group - Join for in game bonus!]\r\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/3497226/Mithril-Games\r\n\r\nWelcome to Giant Simulator! The most competitive simulator on Roblox! Train to become the strongest, fastest, richest player around! Find epic loot and legendary pets as you level up and dominate the server 😈. Can you become a Giant legend?\r\n\r\nNow partnered with Infinite Canvas! Join our group here: https://www.roblox.com/groups/10742963/Infinite-Canvas#!/about","path":"/game/2986677229-giant-simulator","slug":"2986677229-giant-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98b2849888b8ba9ca9b740b278647c69bd8f9aa128ed53b34daeca02c86c1028.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b23800ef783896ec7daad68a21bb9546/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":163774400,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-03T01:56:10.255Z","creator":{"name":"Mithril Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":26838733,"name":"Catalog Heaven ","desc":"Battle with any Roblox-made gear from the avatar marketplace! Or customize your avatar!\n\nDefaults to R6 avatars since not all gear work with R15.\n\nDeveloped by Seranok. Catalog UI by Quenty. Maps by Maelstronomer, Agenttech, duncan779, Shedletsky, and Merely. \"You got bloxxed\" interface by Mazux.","path":"/game/26838733-catalog-heaven","slug":"26838733-catalog-heaven","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/10f45d22de5d41ea8453ca96930b4e479f7d6a505bf2c2941200f436bcf70047.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ae1c08064751eb2accf3b330e90ca23/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":246580080,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-08T09:18:01.939Z","creator":{"name":"Sky Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8619263259,"name":"[Valentines + Skins] Critical Legends","desc":"Critical Legends is now officially discontinued. However, the game will not be shutting down.\nI've simply reached a point where I want to move on and focus on other projects and interests. Please don't be angry or disappointed. Sometimes the healthiest decision a creator can make is to move forward when a project no longer brings them fulfillment.\n\nI hope you can understand my decision.\nTo everyone who has played, supported, contributed to, or simply been part of this community:\n\nThank you.\n\nThank you for the memories, the support, and for making Critical Legends what it became.\n\n\n[v4.0.2]\nFull log in our server\n\nEnter the captivating realm of Critical Legends, where epic adventures shape timeless legacies. Traverse forbidden terrain, face exotic foes, and emerge as a legend. Trading within this world is an art—use \"!trade USERNAME\" in Roblox chat, waiting two minutes between trades. All thanks to the visionary Radi Studios, the architects of this wondrous realm!\n\n","path":"/game/8619263259-critical-legends","slug":"8619263259-critical-legends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3c3302cc95bf1ccd7eb18b3a0dec2b06d8f78410c6e8ac6e8a90e0beaf53c1df.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3af2253d2ebead16ed5c9031e88717b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":43445934,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-26T14:51:41.798Z","creator":{"name":"Radi Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":9,"freeCount":9,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":17265087522,"name":"ROACH (FPS STORY)","desc":"🔥 Progress through linear story missions and fight the roaches in co-op!\n🛠️ This game is a work in progress. It is not meant to be taken seriously. Play with low expectations and have fun.\n\n[Controls]\n🎵 M – Mute Music\n💃 G – Emote\n\n[Premium Benefits]\n🎁 Exclusive daily reward chest.\n\n👥 VIP servers support up to 50 players.\n\n🎮 Inspired by classic Roblox co-op story shooters and many other first-person shooters.\n\n💸 All purchases are optional and support the developers. Stories can be completed for free.\n\n⭐ Like, favorite, and join the group for updates.\n\nTags: fps, action, story, coop, roach, roaches, horror, friends, multiplayer, solve, work together","path":"/game/17265087522-roach","slug":"17265087522-roach","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/020d584e1f4479fe3c48aec38063ab02e3ccbb0a88d28493a97bba6663a98192.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c0e6df18172e3d232df16510bb9086aa/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":40853157,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-30T21:04:09.357Z","creator":{"name":"Dev Noob Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7499189111,"name":"[BIG UPDATE] Encounters ⚔️","desc":"❤️ NEW CODE releasing at 400K Likes! ❤️ \n🔥 Make sure to leave a like and invite your friends to play! 🔥 \n\nDo you like Anime? Do you like fighting games? Then Encounters is the experience for you! \n\nUse your abilities to best your enemies in a fast paced last man standing brawl arena! \n\nWith a large amount of champions and infinite ability combo strategies, there will always be new things to explore. \n\n⚔️ Choose Between 30+ unique champions \n👥 Play with Friends in 2v2, 1v1, and FFA ability-based combat \n🏆 Win competitive matches to earn Trophies \n🗝️ Unlock exclusive Champions and Skins \n💪 Practice against bots \n\nTags: fighting, combat, face off, arena, champions, competitive, casual, tournament, multiplayer \n\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮","path":"/game/7499189111-encounters","slug":"7499189111-encounters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4f69ada465fd29f089fa410430a1af796335420324cb509962e99dac552c584.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e26a36bd51bd98672e70b948b5994709/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":406520815,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-07-17T22:18:07.040Z","creator":{"name":"Encounters by Voldex","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14203,"totalPages":592,"currentPage":258}